  "_status": "PROPOSAL for the owner to edit. Not active anywhere: the engine (src/rafii_control/oncall/) is off unless RAFII_ONCALL_ENGINE_ENABLED is exactly 'true', and nothing in the running application imports it. The roster below is a placeholder with no person and no destination, so roster_problems() reports it and readiness says BLOCKED.",
